<section class="section">
  <div class="content site-container">
    <h1 class="greeting">Hi, good morning <span class="wave">👋</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I’m Jeremy, a web developer with a background in design and a passion for UX.
    </p>
    <div class="body">
      <p>
        The path I have taken over the last twenty years has led me to approach web development with
        a wide perspective. Many of my colleagues have seen me as the “glue” that keeps the team
        together.
      </p>
      <p>
        I thrive at methodically hashing out ideas to build interactions that just make sense to
        users. I am well seasoned with over twenty years in the industry.
      </p>
      <p>
        I want to personally thank you for stopping by and visiting my website. Other things you
        might want to do around here are <a href="/work">check out my work</a>, learn more <a
          href="/about">about me</a
        > or <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    background-color: #fff;
    background-image: url("/images/hero-texture.svg");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center bottom;
    background-size: cover;
    isolation: isolate;
    padding-top: 6rem; /* leave room for header */
    container-type: inline-size;
  }

  .section::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 60%), rgb(255 255 255 / 85%));
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 6rem var(--container-padding) 6rem;
  }
  .content .site-container {
    padding: 0;
  }

  .greeting {
    font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .body {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .body a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Container query: adjust sizes when container is wide */
  @container (min-width:60ch) {
    .greeting {
      font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    }
    .body {
      font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    }
  }

  .wave {
    display: inline-block;
  }
</style>
